🛰️ Spacecraft Constellation Fault Simulator
A comprehensive GUI-based spacecraft constellation simulator built on the Basilisk astrodynamics framework. This simulator enables the modeling of multi-satellite constellations, injection of realistic reaction wheel faults, and analysis of fault propagation effects through advanced plotting and 3D visualization via Vizard.
